{"title": "Spellcrux Amulet", "pageid": 9686, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spellcrux_Amulet", "categories": ["Amulets", "Very rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img alt=\"Spellcrux Amulet controller icon\" src=\"/w/images/a/a3/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Spellcrux Amulet</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulet</a> that allows the wearer to restore any one spell slot once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Some scholars have speculated that spells have a mind of their own, suggesting that the spells get bored between being cast and restored.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/38px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/50px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amulets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 210 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  210  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Restoration_SpellSlotRestoration_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Restoration_SpellSlotRestoration_Amulet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Restoration_SpellSlotRestoration_Amulet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ba147dc7-98bc-4bfb-9fbc-efa1735d0841</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ba147dc7-98bc-4bfb-9fbc-efa1735d0841\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ba147dc7-98bc-4bfb-9fbc-efa1735d0841\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration\" title=\"Spell Slot Restoration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/60px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/80px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Slot Restoration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration\" title=\"Spell Slot Restoration\">Spell Slot Restoration</a></dt>\n<dd>Replenish an expended <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slots\" title=\"Spells\">spell slot</a> of any level as a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers_Prison\" title=\"Moonrise Towers Prison\">Moonrise Towers Prison</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;569&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-650</span>: Worn by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Warden\" title=\"The Warden\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_The_Warden.png/25px-Portrait_The_Warden.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_The_Warden.png/38px-Portrait_The_Warden.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_The_Warden.png/50px-Portrait_The_Warden.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warden\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_The_Warden.png/25px-Portrait_The_Warden.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_The_Warden.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Warden\" title=\"The Warden\">Warden</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The amulet cannot create new <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slots\" title=\"Spells\">spell slots</a>, only restore used ones. If you do not have a used spell slot of the level you chose, the amulet has no effect.</li>\n<li>The amulet can recover spell slots that the caster does not innately have from their class, such as ones gained from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Create_Spell_Slot\" title=\"Create Spell Slot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp/25px-Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp/38px-Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp/50px-Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Create Spell Slot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp/25px-Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Create_Spell_Slot_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Create_Spell_Slot\" title=\"Create Spell Slot\">Create Spell Slot</a>, or ones from gear, such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Devotion\" title=\"Shield of Devotion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Shield_of_Devotion_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Devotion\" title=\"Shield of Devotion\">Shield of Devotion</a>.</li>\n<li>It is capable of recovering both Warlock spell slots and regular spell slots. If you have empty spell slots of both types for the chosen level, it restores one slot for each type.</li>\n<li>Likewise, if the amulet is equipped by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> and he has the <a href=\"/wiki/Consumed_Shadow_Weave\" title=\"Consumed Shadow Weave\">Consumed Shadow Weave</a> feature, selecting third level will restore both a normal third-level spell slot and the third-level \"shadow spell slot\" granted by this feature.</li>\n<li>The spell slot is not lost when the amulet is removed, meaning you can put the amulet on, restore a slot, and switch back to another amulet of your choice. The recharge is still tied to the amulet, so this cannot be done with multiple characters at once.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201813\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2718/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37132/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10496/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1286235/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.596      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   63.596      1 -total\n 29.32%   18.643      8 Template:Icon_text\n 26.56%   16.889     27 Template:Trim\n 23.72%   15.085      5 Template:Icon_link\n 17.34%   11.025     11 Template:Ifempty\n 15.05%    9.570      2 Template:Uid\n 14.53%    9.241      1 Template:WeaponType\n  9.93%    6.314      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  9.68%    6.155      1 Template:RarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9686-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201813 and revision id 370284. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}